ng experience.\n\n**Tips and Recommendations:**\n\n1. Book your VIP Experience or special dining packages in advance to ensure availability.\n2. Plan your visit strategically to make the most of your time and priority entry benefits.\n3. Consider visiting during the week or on off-peak days to avoid crowds.\n4. Don't forget to check the event maps and schedules for food locations, show times, and attraction availability.\n\nI hope these suggestions help you plan an unforgettable theme park weekend!",
